    "title": "Oscar Health",
    "description": "The Oscar app puts your health insurance plan in your pocket. That way you can do just about anything related to your health\u2014from anywhere. Oh, and, it\u2019s easy on the eyes.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s some great stuff you can do with the app:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Get your digital ID card\r\n\u2022 Search for the right care or even your symptoms\u2014ACHOOO!\r\n\u2022 Talk to a doc 24/7\r\n\u2022 Get your prescriptions refilled with a few clicks\r\n\u2022 See all your insurance info in ONE place\r\n\u2022 Message us with whatever you need\r\n\r\nWalk, and get rewarded:\r\n\u2022 Track your steps with your phone (or connect to compatible step tracking devices)\r\n\u2022 You\u2019ll earn $ for hitting your step goals\u2014yay!",
